Swoole for mysqlnd with OpenSSL: the module swoole of php82-swoole (with
OpenSSL there too: swoole 6.2 has no build without it), with
php82-mysqlnd-openssl instead of php82-mysqlnd. The same files as
php82-swoole: install one of the two.

PECL swoole for php82 of azsupport/ports, built from ext/swoole of the
release tarball of azsupport/php-src, which bundles it:
lib/php/20220829/swoole.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php82/conf.d.
